data: {"id": "6e87fe66465f4e65-thinking-parallel_evidence-1788", "run_id": "6e87fe66465f4e65", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Topology 采集成功。结果摘要：\n\n- **Pod UID**: `50716f01-3d9a-4796-9128-20ec4c2de842`\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.17`\n- **Owner**: Replicaset `workload-79d9f8fd88:28859877-ef98-46cd-a109-9667552273d6`\n- **Service**: `workload:79349fed-889a-4579-92c1-0557bff21645` 选择器指向该 Pod\n- **Container**: `app`\n\nTopology 维度重新采集成功，证据完整。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789097407068, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

